{"org":"elastic","repo":"elasticsearch","prNumber":"111475","commit":"4338849a7234d850cb45990462e5da75e0b29ce7","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The change in `resolveStats` from using `Expressions.attribute` to `Expressions.attributeUnchecked` is justified by the comment about union types and conversion functions. However, ensure that this change does not inadvertently skip necessary type checks elsewhere in the codebase where `Expressions.attribute` was previously used.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java-22751:22760-22662:22776,22797:22816,22866:22884","promptId":"#55F2X","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":22751,"endPos":22760,"startLine":464,"startLineOffset":49,"endLine":464,"endLineOffset":58,"length":10}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":22662,"endPos":22776,"startLine":463,"startLineOffset":20,"endLine":463,"endLineOffset":134,"length":115},{"pos":22797,"endPos":22816,"startLine":464,"startLineOffset":20,"endLine":464,"endLineOffset":39,"length":20},{"pos":22866,"endPos":22884,"startLine":465,"startLineOffset":49,"endLine":465,"endLineOffset":67,"length":19}]}]},{"comment":"The removal of `resolveAttribute` in favor of handling unresolved attributes differently seems to be part of a larger refactoring effort. Ensure that all places where `resolveAttribute` was used are now correctly handled by the new logic, especially since this method was responsible for resolving against a list and returning appropriate expressions.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java-57105:57576-","promptId":"#3D7XF","src